Third-party software in Swell
=============================

Swell is free software under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or
later (the file COPYING). The swell-player executable also contains the
Rust crates listed below, each under the licence it is listed with; the
full text of every licence follows its list of crates, and the NOTICE
files the crates' licences ask to be passed on are at the end.

The Windows and macOS packages also bundle GTK, GStreamer and the other
libraries Swell uses; those are listed, with their licences and where to
get their sources, in the files next to this one.

Generated by cargo-about from Cargo.lock for every system Swell is
released for, so some of these crates are only in some builds.

